# Flying deck is the production course

`/` (Vercel) and `/kaik/` (GitHub Pages) are the **preserved flying card deck** — the Cargo iframe embed on kaik.pictures.

- Source: `index.html` + `src/main.js` (deck fly / focus / destBox / spread stack).
- Do **not** replace, gut, or swap this route for the split list.
- Do **not** port fly-lock, destBox, pointer parallax, fan-on-focus, or deck progress onto `/list`.

The split-layout list is a **separate product**:

| Product | Vercel | GitHub Pages | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Flying deck (keep) | `/` | `/kaik/` | `index.html` |
| Split list (new) | `/list` | `/kaik/list` | `list.html` |

If you change course cards, reuse markup/CSS in `list.html` — do not delete the deck to “make room” for the list.
